<% content_for(:title) { "About — Reflekto" } %>
<% content_for(:head) do %>
  <meta name="description" content="Reflekto was built by Muhammad — a developer tired of paying subscriptions just to journal on more than one device. Free, private, and focused.">
<% end %>

<%# ---- NAV ---- %>
<nav class="landing-nav landing-nav--light">
  <div class="ln-nav__inner">
    <%= link_to "Reflekto", root_path, class: "ln-nav__brand" %>
    <div class="ln-nav__actions">
      <%= link_to "Sign In", new_user_session_path, class: "ln-nav__link" %>
      <%= link_to new_user_registration_path, class: "ln-nav__cta" do %>
        Get Started <span class="ln-nav__cta-arrow">→</span>
      <% end %>
    </div>
  </div>
</nav>

<%# ---- ABOUT HERO ---- %>
<main class="about-page">
  <div class="about-page__inner">

    <span class="about-page__eyebrow">The story behind Reflekto</span>
    <h1 class="about-page__headline">Hi, I'm<br>Muhammad.</h1>

    <%# ---- STORY ---- %>
    <div class="about-page__body">
      <p>Most journaling apps are brilliant — until they ask you to pay a monthly subscription just to use them on more than one device. I kept running into this wall. Great tools, but the moment you need your phone and laptop in sync, there's a price tag attached. For something as personal as a journal, that felt wrong.</p>

      <p>I know how to code. So I built Reflekto — not as a startup, not as a product roadmap with investors, but as a tool I needed to exist. A private, focused journaling space that works everywhere, costs nothing, and gets out of the way.</p>

      <p>Reflekto is built around two ideas: <strong>simplicity</strong> and <strong>privacy</strong>. Your journal belongs to you — no ads, no algorithms, no one reading what you write. Colour-coded notebooks, rich text editing, tags, search, writing prompts, streak tracking — everything a serious journaler needs, without anything that isn't.</p>

      <p>If you've ever felt like your journal app was working against you — too expensive, too complicated, asking for too much — Reflekto was made for you. I hope it gives you the space to write freely and think clearly.</p>

      <p class="about-page__signature">— Muhammad</p>
    </div>

    <%# ---- VALUES ---- %>
    <div class="about-values">
      <div class="about-value">
        <div class="about-value__icon">
          <i class="fa-solid fa-lock" aria-hidden="true"></i>
        </div>
        <h3>Privacy first</h3>
        <p>No ads. No tracking. No sharing. Your words stay yours — always.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="about-value">
        <div class="about-value__icon">
          <i class="fa-solid fa-pen-nib" aria-hidden="true"></i>
        </div>
        <h3>Simplicity by design</h3>
        <p>Every feature earns its place. Nothing here just to look impressive.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="about-value">
        <div class="about-value__icon">
          <i class="fa-solid fa-heart" aria-hidden="true"></i>
        </div>
        <h3>Free, forever</h3>
        <p>No subscription. No paywalled devices. No catch. Just write.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <%# ---- CTA ---- %>
    <div class="about-page__cta">
      <%= link_to "Start writing — it's free", new_user_registration_path, class: "ln-btn ln-btn--primary" %>
      <%= link_to "Sign in", new_user_session_path, class: "ln-btn ln-btn--ghost" %>
    </div>

  </div>
</main>

<%# ---- FOOTER ---- %>
<footer class="ln-footer">
  <div class="ln-footer__inner">
    <div class="ln-footer__brand">
      Reflekto
      <span class="ln-footer__tagline">Write freely. Think clearly.</span>
    </div>
    <div class="ln-footer__cols">
      <div class="ln-footer__col">
        <p class="ln-footer__col-heading">Legal</p>
        <%= link_to "Terms of Service", terms_path, class: "ln-footer__link" %>
        <%= link_to "Privacy Policy", privacy_path, class: "ln-footer__link" %>
      </div>
      <div class="ln-footer__col">
        <p class="ln-footer__col-heading">Company</p>
        <%= link_to "About Us", about_path, class: "ln-footer__link" %>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="ln-footer__bottom">
    <span>© 2026 Reflekto. All rights reserved.</span>
  </div>
</footer>
